Incident -- misattributed teaching, caught by the transcript
============================================================
freeze tag: experiment-4-frozen (99fa78a). Kept verbatim as evidence
of a real failure mode: on the first B3-B run the operator approved
and taught against request [2] (the side-obligation Need (eq (plus p
q) _0)) while supplying the solutionmap theorem that addressed
request [3]. The counterfactual unlock was real -- the goal closed --
so the machine promoted the WRONG node and recorded an episode
pairing request 2's residual with request 3's rule. The instrument
permitted it: teach_dependency does not require the taught conclusion
to address the request's Need. Recorded as an instrument observation
for a future cut (a warning when the taught conclusion does not unify
with the Need term); the session was discarded and the chain rerun
with aligned indices. Operator error is data.

